    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n51384" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">vŏrācĭtas</span></b> ,
			ātis, f.
		vorax, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>greediness</i>, <i>ravenousness</i>, <i>voracity</i> (post-Aug.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ingluvie et voracitate notabilis,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Eutr. 7, 12</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">asini,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">App. M. 7, p. 200</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Transf.</b>, of fire: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">avidissima,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					2, 107, 111, § 239</span></i>
			.</div>
